    "I am now",
    "getting over the",
    "first sharpness",
    "of grief; but",
    "now and then,",
    "especially at night,",
    "I feel that the",
    "iron has entered",
    "into my soul.",
    "It seems so terrible",
    "to have lost the",
    "one who helped",
    "me, if only with",
    "advice, in everything",
    "and from whom",
    "I concealed noth-",
    "-ing.",
